        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Japanese Horror × Monsters × Escape —</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Where’s my mom…?”<br>Yuni, the young protagonist, wakes up in a strange otherworld—<br>a place she has never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Niraya of ■■”</strong> is a Japanese-style horror adventure where a powerless child must flee from monstrous beings and fight to return home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 2000, late summer —</strong><br>During a ritual held at a small temple in rural Japan, Yuni suddenly loses consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wakes up inside a cold refrigerator.<br>Her mother is nowhere to be found—<br>and the outside world has completely transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lantern-lined tunnels, temple-like structures—<br>and uncanny, twisted creatures roaming the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Yuni can do is move forward,<br>dodging attacks and fleeing from the monsters that hunt her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longing once more for her mother’s warmth—<br>a child’s desperate escape from the otherworld begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/01217fe79f71cccd406f7922611dfb0b.poster.avif?t=1782269834\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/01217fe79f71cccd406f7922611dfb0b.webm?t=1782269834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● A truth that slowly reveals itself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and collect notes to uncover why Yuni was taken into this realm and the deeper mysteries behind her situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● The terror of being unable to fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuni has <strong>no means of combat</strong>.<br>Sense murderous intent, hide, run, and narrowly avoid attacks to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Tension born from stamina management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running drains stamina and leaves Yuni unable to move.<br>Reckless sprinting will quickly lead to being cornered.<br>Manage stamina carefully to escape your pursuers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/8bd2bda34aeb2f1c409edf94c9e2e2b2.poster.avif?t=1782269834\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/8bd2bda34aeb2f1c409edf94c9e2e2b2.webm?t=1782269834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● A Japanese otherworld inspired by medieval Buddhist imagery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Buddha statues, massive mandalas, and sudden modern road signs—<br>a world that feels structured yet profoundly unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/bf4da65d7eae28f5b8abb6eb5b12ff1b.poster.avif?t=1782269834\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/bf4da65d7eae28f5b8abb6eb5b12ff1b.webm?t=1782269834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● A vast and atmospheric world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A temple field filled with red spider lilies; rows of spinning pinwheels—<br>Explore eerie yet beautiful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/7ff88180cfbd93286d11034ed3705405.poster.avif?t=1782269834\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/7ff88180cfbd93286d11034ed3705405.webm?t=1782269834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approx. 6–8 hours</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, creeping horror / Tense chases / Japanese-style horror / Isolation / Pursuit</p>",
