=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/7ff88180cfbd93286d11034ed3705405.poster.avif?t=1782269834\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/7ff88180cfbd93286d11034ed3705405.webm?t=1782269834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approx. 6–8 hours</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, creeping horror / Tense chases / Japanese-style horror / Isolation / Pursuit</p>",
